Third-party material used by the fizz conformance suite
=======================================================

This directory contains material from the OpenAPI Initiative (OAI). It is
used only as test data. fizz does not ship it in the library.

1. OAI/learn.openapis.org (examples)
   Files:    orig/learn/examples/v3.{0,1,2}/*.yaml
   Commit:   82b82f372aa185a07ea11bc158619895ab21f741
   Licence:  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
             https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
             Full text: LICENSE-learn-CC-BY-4.0
   Source:   https://github.com/OAI/learn.openapis.org
   Copyright the OpenAPI Initiative / The Linux Foundation and contributors.

2. OAI/OpenAPI-Specification (schema test fixtures)
   Files:    orig/oas/tests/schema/pass/*.yaml, orig/oas/tests/schema/fail/*.yaml
   Commit:   0f9aa49039215e2ed414cdefe35f718273b77976
   Licence:  Apache License 2.0
             https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
             Full text: LICENSE-oas-Apache-2.0
   Source:   https://github.com/OAI/OpenAPI-Specification

3. OAI/OpenAPI-Specification (specification text)
   Files:    orig/oas/versions/3.2.1.md
   Commit:   4f86429f134f7e48b6351563549b4502fc69de52
   Licence:  Apache License 2.0 (same as above)

Files under orig/ are unmodified copies of the upstream files at the commits
above. Their path, commit, source path, sha256 and licence are listed in
MANIFEST.json, which is verified by "go generate" (internal/conformance/internal/fetchoai)
and by TestManifestMatchesFiles.

Modified copies
---------------

The upgraded/ directory (added later by task P10.1) contains copies of these
files that were modified by a deterministic converter, for example to raise
the "openapi" version to 3.2.1. These are modified versions, not the
originals. The changes made to each file are listed per file in this NOTICE,
as required by CC BY 4.0 section 3(a)(1)(B).
